
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <meta name="description" content="Portofolio fotografi Baselius Jamario Agung. Mengabadikan cerita dalam setiap bingkai.">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#f5f1e9">

  <title>Baselius Jamario Agung | Photography</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    :root {
      --cream: #f5f1e9;
      --beige: #d8d0c4;
      --dark: #282823;
      --muted: #777166;
      --white: #fffdf9;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
      scroll-padding-top: 90px;
    }

    body {
      background: var(--cream);
      color: var(--dark);
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
    }

    nav {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 10;
      padding: 18px 8%;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 20px;
      background: rgba(245, 241, 233, 0.96);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(40, 40, 35, 0.1);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    }

    nav h2 {
      font: 700 28px Georgia, serif;
      margin: 0;
    }

    nav .links {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 22px;
    }

    nav a {
      font-size: 14px;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    nav .links a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
      text-underline-offset: 5px;
    }

    .hero {
      min-height: 82vh;
      padding: 100px 8%;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: flex-start;
      background:
        linear-gradient(110deg, rgba(216, 208, 196, 0.98),
        rgba(216, 208, 196, 0.78));
    }

    .eyebrow {
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: bold;
      letter-spacing: 4px;
    }

    h1 {
      font: 400 clamp(46px, 8vw, 92px)/1.08 Georgia, serif;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      letter-spacing: -2px;
    }

    .hero .intro {
      max-width: 480px;
      color: #514c43;
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      width: fit-content;
      padding: 13px 22px;
      margin-top: 25px;
      background: var(--dark);
      color: white;
      border: 1px solid var(--dark);
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: background 0.2s, color 0.2s;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--dark);
    }

    section {
      padding: 85px 8%;
    }

    .section-heading {
      font: 400 clamp(34px, 5vw, 48px) Georgia, serif;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .section-description {
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .gallery {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .photo {
      overflow: hidden;
      background: #e4ddd1;
    }

    .photo img {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      height: 340px;
      object-fit: cover;
      transition: transform 0.5s;
    }

    .photo:hover img {
      transform: scale(1.04);
    }

    .photo figcaption {
      padding: 12px 14px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #514c43;
    }

    .about {
      background: #e9e1d5;
    }

    .about-content {
      max-width: 750px;
    }

    .about p {
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.9;
    }

    .services {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
      margin-top: 30px;
    }

    .service {
      padding: 24px;
      border: 1px solid #d8d0c4;
      background: rgba(255, 253, 249, 0.55);
    }

    .service h3 {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font: 400 24px Georgia, serif;
    }

    .service p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .contact {
      background: var(--dark);
      color: var(--cream);
    }

    .contact p {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .contact a:not(.btn) {
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
      text-underline-offset: 4px;
    }

    .contact .btn {
      background: var(--cream);
      color: var(--dark);
      border-color: var(--cream);
    }

    .contact .btn:hover {
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--cream);
    }

    footer {
      padding: 24px 8%;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    @media (max-width: 760px) {
      nav {
        padding: 16px 5%;
        align-items: flex-start;
      }

      nav h2 {
        font-size: 23px;
      }

      nav .links {
        justify-content: flex-end;
        gap: 8px 14px;
      }

      nav .links a {
        font-size: 12px;
      }

      .hero {
        min-height: 72vh;
        padding: 80px 7%;
      }

      section {
        padding: 65px 7%;
      }

      .gallery {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .photo img {
        height: 260px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      nav {
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 10px;
      }

      nav .links {
        justify-content: flex-start;
      }

      h1 {
        letter-spacing: -1px;
      }

      .gallery,
      .services {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .photo img {
        height: 300px;
      }

      .eyebrow {
        font-size: 10px;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
      }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      html {
        scroll-behavior: auto;
      }

      *, *::before, *::after {
        transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <nav aria-label="Navigasi utama">
    <h2>Baselius.</h2>

    <div class="links">
      <a href="#portfolio">Portofolio</a>
      <a href="#about">Tentang</a>
      <a href="#services">Layanan</a>
      <a href="#contact">Kontak</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <header class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">PHOTOGRAPHER &amp; VISUAL STORYTELLER</p>

    <h1>Baselius<br>Jamario Agung</h1>

    <p class="intro">
      Mengabadikan cerita dalam setiap bingkai.
      Menemukan keindahan dalam cahaya, detail,
      dan momen sederhana.
    </p>

    <a class="btn" href="#portfolio">Lihat Portofolio ↗</a>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section id="portfolio">
      <h2 class="section-heading">Portofolio</h2>
      <p class="section-description">
        Beberapa momen yang saya abadikan.
      </p>

      <div class="gallery">
        <figure class="photo">
          <img src="foto1.jpg" alt="Karya fotografi pertama"
               loading="lazy"
               onerror="this.style.display='none'">
          <figcaption>01 — Moments</figcaption>
        </figure>

        <figure class="photo">
          <img src="foto2.jpg" alt="Karya fotografi kedua"
               loading="lazy"
               onerror="this.style.display='none'">
          <figcaption>02 — Details</figcaption>
        </figure>

        <figure class="photo">
          <img src="foto3.jpg" alt="Karya fotografi ketiga"
               loading="lazy"
               onerror="this.style.display='none'">
          <figcaption>03 — Stories</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="about" class="about">
      <div class="about-content">
        <h2 class="section-heading">Tentang Saya</h2>
        <p>
          Saya Baselius Jamario Agung, seorang pencinta
          fotografi yang menyukai keindahan dalam detail,
          cahaya, dan momen sederhana. Saya percaya bahwa
          setiap foto memiliki cerita yang layak untuk dikenang.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="services">
      <h2 class="section-heading">Layanan</h2>
      <p class="section-description">
        Dokumentasi visual untuk berbagai kebutuhan.
      </p>

      <div class="services">
        <article class="service">
          <h3>Portrait</h3>
          <p>Foto personal dengan karakter dan cerita tersendiri.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="service">
          <h3>Event</h3>
          <p>Mengabadikan momen penting dan suasana acara.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="service">
          <h3>Product</h3>
          <p>Foto produk dengan komposisi yang menarik.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="service">
          <h3>Documentation</h3>
          <p>Dokumentasi kegiatan, perjalanan, dan kenangan.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact" class="contact">
      <h2 class="section-heading">Mari Bercerita</h2>
      <p>
        Tertarik bekerja sama atau ingin berdiskusi
        tentang sesi foto? Silakan hubungi saya.
      </p>

      <p>
        Email:
        <a href="mailto:baseliusjamarioagung.foto@gmail.com">
          baseliusjamarioagung.foto@gmail.com
        </a>
      </p>

      <p>
        Instagram:
        <a href="https://instagram.com/agung.vibes"
           target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          @agung.vibes
        </a>
      </p>

      <a class="btn"
         href="https://wa.me/6285199396129"
         target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Hubungi via WhatsApp ↗
      </a>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    © <span id="year">2026</span> Baselius Jamario Agung Photography
  </footer>

  <script>
    document.getElementById("year").textContent =
      new Date().getFullYear();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
